    "code": " N, K = map(int, input().split())\n\npre = [input()]\n\nans = 0\n\nk = 1\n\nf = 0\n\nwhile True:\n\n    if k >= K:\n\n        print(ans)\n\n        break\n\n    if len(pre) == 0:\n\n        print(-1)\n\n        break\n\n    post = []\n\n    for s in pre:\n\n        for i in range(len(s)):\n\n            t = s[:i] + s[i+1:]\n\n            if t not in post:\n\n                k += 1\n\n                post.append(t)\n\n                ans += N-len(t)\n\n                if k >= K:\n\n                    print(ans)\n\n                    f = 1\n\n                    break\n\n        if f:\n\n            break\n\n    if f:\n\n        break\n\n    pre = post",
